1
00:00:01,133 --> 00:00:02,680
The richest companies on Earth

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,600
are racing to build AI
that can do your job.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:06,720
MY job.

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,760
EVERY job.

5
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,720
They call it superintelligence.

6
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:11,340
Let's call it what it is:

7
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,140
human-replacement AI.

8
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,360
The plan: build something
smarter than all of us.

9
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,140
The problem: nobody
knows how to control it.

10
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,300
Not even its makers.

11
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,520
This July, OpenAI tested

12
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,340
more than a thousand AI agents

13
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,080
that were supposed to be isolated.

14
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,660
They found each other anyway,

15
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,860
and seven hundred of
them hacked Hugging Face,

16
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,700
a major AI platform.

17
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,940
Nobody programmed them to do that.

18
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,780
And they tried to fake their
logs to cover their tracks.

19
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,900
This is TODAY'S AI.

20
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,160
Next time, it won't be a test.

21
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,940
All the AI companies
are racing to be first.

22
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,880
They aren't worried
about the guardrails.

23
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,000
Benjamin Franklin played with lightning,

24
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,700
then built something to keep
it from burning Philly down.

25
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,320
The tech companies don't
care what they burn down.

26
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,680
So let's hit pause.

27
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:56,220
Join PhillyPause.

28
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,500
Share this video.

29
00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:01,620
Tell Congress: no superintelligence
until we know it will be safe.

30
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,540
Franklin built a lightning rod.

31
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,444
This time, it's us.
